-- Per slot i the read puts mass (Nil, Obj) on logits 4i..4i+1 and (Red,
-- Green) on 4i+2..4i+3. flip . flip = id, so each row is the read's own
-- probability of the queried scene, a product over the specified slots.
-- Kept out of End2End's Normalization sweep (no-normalization), which samples
-- the output and cannot cover a 3^10 support.
